OL,3,GNEWSAWoman raped by stranger on city
OL,4,Acommon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been raped by a stranger in
OL,7,FSouthampton.
OL,9,FThe attack happened on Southampton
OL,10,FCommon, near Cemetery Road, shortly
OL,11,Fafter 05:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe area was cordoned off to allow
OL,14,Fforensic teams to examine the scene but
OL,15,Fthe restrictions have now been lifted.
OL,17,FAnyone who saw or heard anything or who
OL,18,Fhas dashcam, CCTV or doorbell footage
OL,19,Fis urged to contact Hampshire
OL,20,FConstabulary.
